@startuml AD-9
!include _style.iuml
title AD-9 (System level) — Handle billing exceptions: refunds and e-invoice retry\nTrigger: Admin picks an item on Billing Exceptions, or a Driver closes the account\nUse cases: UC-ADM-08, UC-ACC-02 · Rules: BR-P13, BR-P14, BR-P21, BR-P44, BR-P45

|«person»\nDriver|
|«person»\nAdmin|
|«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
|«external system»\nPayment\nGateway|
|«external system»\nE-Invoice\nProvider|
|«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
start
if ( ) then ([Admin picks an item])
  |«person»\nAdmin|
  :Open Billing Exceptions\nand choose an item;
  |«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
  if ( ) then ([top-up to refund])
    :Check that the balance\ncovers the top-up;
    if ( ) then ([balance < top-up amount,\nor top-up not credited])
      :Refuse with reason;
      stop
    else ([balance covers it])
      :Record the refund at once: debit\ncredit, restore redeemed points;
      :TopUp\n&#91;refunded&#93;]
      :LoyaltyTransaction\n&#91;restore&#93;]
    endif
  else ([else])
    if ( ) then ([e-invoice needs review])
      :Send the e-invoice to the provider\nagain, once (attempt count not reset)>
      if ( ) then ([issued by the provider])
        :EInvoice\n&#91;issued&#93;]
      else ([provider error])
        :EInvoice\n&#91;needs_review&#93;]
      endif
      stop
    else ([late payment to refund,\nor failed refund to retry])
    endif
  endif
else ([Driver closed the account])
  |«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
  :Debit unused credit and split it\nover the newest credited top-ups;
  :CreditAccount\n&#91;closed&#93;]
endif
if ( ) then ([failed refund\nbeing retried])
else ([new refund])
  :Create refund request\n(one per top-up and kind);
  :Refund\n&#91;requested&#93;]
endif
:Send refund to the original payment\nsource (automatic retries after 5 min,\n30 min, 2 h; unknown result: query\nthe gateway before any resend)>
|«external system»\nPayment\nGateway|
:Process refund and\nreturn the result>
|«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
if ( ) then ([rejected, or fourth\nattempt failed])
  :List the failed refund on\nBilling Exceptions, notify Admin;
  :Refund\n&#91;failed&#93;]
  stop
else ([confirmed by the gateway])
endif
:Refund\n&#91;done&#93;]
:Request adjustment invoice\nfor the amount refunded>
|«external system»\nE-Invoice\nProvider|
:Issue adjustment\ninvoice;
|«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
if ( ) then ([issued])
  :InvoiceAdjustment\n&#91;issued&#93;]
else ([error after\nautomatic retries])
  :InvoiceAdjustment\n&#91;needs_review&#93;]
endif
:Notify Driver that the\nrefund was sent (MSG25);
|«person»\nDriver|
:Receive refund\nconfirmation;
stop
@enduml
